{
  "name": "hebrewcalendar-firestore-rules-tests",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Firestore Security Rules tests (RULES.md \u00a75, TESTING_AND_DEPLOY.md). Run via `npm test` from this directory; starts the Firestore emulator.",
